The plate looks like a dinner plate of about 24-26 cm. It holds two items. The first is a toasted bread slice topped with arugula, cheese, and vegetables. The second is a pile of caramelized onion or cabbage mixed with greens, which may sit on another bread slice.

The bread slice measures roughly 10x8 cm, so with toppings it weighs about 90 g and comes to about 220 kcal. The pile on the right is about 100 g of cooked vegetables with some oil, around 130 kcal. Together that is about 190 g and 350 kcal.

